A workflow us a sequence of activities or steps that are performed in a specific order to achieve a business goal

Think of it as a map that shows
1. what happens first
2. what happens next
3. who preforms each action
4. what decisions are made
5. when the process ends

   Example(Simple work flow)
      Customer Enquiry
            ↓
       Lead Created
            ↓
Salesperson Contacts Customer
            ↓
       Interested?
       ↙        ↘
      Yes         No
       ↓            ↓
   Site Visit   Close Lead

A workflow defines the path a record follows from start to finish, including actions, decisions, approvals, and notifications.
        
